                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Other than the fact that you can get 6 easy achievements by playing this game, this game is not worth it. Its a simple \"bowling\" game that looks as if it took maybe an hour to make. I put bowling in quotes simply because there's no real elements to bowling other than throwing balls down a lane at glass bottles. There's no frames, there's no score keeping. There's one level on an island, and that's it.",
